# UI

- `packages/ui/src/components/**` except `dimah/` is generated by `pnpm ui:sync`: don't hand-edit it.
- Base UI, not Radix: `render={<Link … />}` with `nativeButton={false}` instead of `asChild`.
- `import { cn } from "cn"`; logical Tailwind (`ms`/`me`, `start`/`end`); text from `@repo/i18n`.

Guide: [docs/agents/ui.md](docs/agents/ui.md)
